---
// Interactive BMS Questionnaire Component - 7 Clinical Diagnostic Categories
---

<div class="bms-quiz-wrapper">
	<div class="quiz-header-banner">
		<p class="quiz-callout">
			<strong>Want to help advance BMS research?</strong> Answer the 7-part clinical questionnaire below to map your symptom profile. When finished, click <strong>Submit Anonymous Data</strong>. It is 100% anonymous, with no name or email&nbsp;required.
		</p>
	</div>

	<form id="bms-quiz-form" class="quiz-form">
		<!-- Section 1 -->
		<div class="quiz-section">
			<h3 class="quiz-section-title">1. Pain Characteristics, Timing &amp; Evolution</h3>
			
			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">How would you describe the sensation: is it a scalding or burning heat, an electric shock, a dull ache, or raw&nbsp;hypersensitivity?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Pain sensation type">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="scalding-heat">Scalding / Burning Heat</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="electric-shock">Electric Shock / Stabbing</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="dull-ache">Dull Ache</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="raw-hypersensitivity">Raw Hypersensitivity</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="mixed">Mixed Sensations</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Does the pain follow a daily cycle (e.g., worse upon waking in the morning, or starts mild and builds toward the&nbsp;evening)?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Daily cycle pattern">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="builds-evening">Starts Mild, Builds by Evening</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="worse-morning">Worse Upon Waking in Morning</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="constant">Constant Intensity All Day</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="unpredictable">Unpredictable / Fluctuating</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Does the pain wake you up from sleep, or does it only bother you during the&nbsp;day?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Sleep interruption">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="day-only">Only Bothers During Day</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="sometimes-wakes">Sometimes Wakes Me From Sleep</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="frequently-wakes">Frequently Wakes Me at Night</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">What is your baseline intensity on a scale of 0 to 10, and what does it spike to during a&nbsp;flare?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Baseline and spike intensity">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="mild-spike">Baseline 1-3 (Spikes to 7-10)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="mod-spike">Baseline 4-6 (Spikes to 8-10)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="severe-constant">Constant 7-10 High Pain</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="variable-baseline">Variable / No Clear Baseline</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Section 2 -->
		<div class="quiz-section">
			<h3 class="quiz-section-title">2. Triggers, Provocations &amp; Aggravating Factors</h3>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Does touching the gumline, light brushing, or passing dental floss trigger a sharp, instantaneous spike (e.g., shooting to a&nbsp;10/10)?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Flossing and gumline mechanical spike">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="sharp-spike">Yes (Sharp Flossing / Brushing Spike)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="mild-tender">Mild Tenderness</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="no-spike">No Spike</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">How do your teeth and gums react to temperature changes, specifically ice water, hot liquids, or cold&nbsp;air?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Temperature sensitivity">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="sharp-cold">Sharp Cold Water Pain</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="hot-liquids">Hot Liquids Trigger Burning</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="cold-air">Cold Air Breathing Sensitivity</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="no-temp">No Reaction to Temperature</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Do acidic foods or drinks (citrus, coffee, wine, carbonated water) sting immediately upon contact, or do you notice a delayed flare 24 to 72 hours&nbsp;later?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Acid trigger timing">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="immediate">Immediate Contact Stinging</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="delayed">Delayed Flare (24-72h Later)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="both">Both Immediate &amp; Delayed</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="neither">Neither / No Effect</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Does chewing or biting down firmly reproduce or worsen the&nbsp;discomfort?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Chewing or biting pressure pain">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="yes-bite">Yes (Biting / Chewing Hurts)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="mild-bite">Mild Pressure Discomfort</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="no-bite">No Pressure Pain</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Section 3 -->
		<div class="quiz-section">
			<h3 class="quiz-section-title">3. Anatomical Distribution &amp; Radiation</h3>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Can you point to a single tooth with one finger, or is the discomfort spread across entire quadrants, gums, or the&nbsp;palate?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Localization vs spread">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="quadrant-spread">Spread Across Quadrants / Palate</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="single-tooth">Point to 1-2 Specific Teeth</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="shifts">Shifts and Migrates Around</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Does the discomfort radiate into your cheeks, the roof of your mouth, your nose, or deep into the ear&nbsp;canal?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Radiation pathways">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="radiates-deep">Yes (Radiates to Ear, Cheek, or Nose)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="mild-radiation">Occasional Mild Radiation</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="no-radiation">No (Confined to Mouth Surface)</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Is the pain strictly one-sided (unilateral), or does it cross the midline to involve both sides of your&nbsp;face?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Unilateral vs bilateral">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="unilateral">Strictly One-Sided (Unilateral)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="bilateral">Both Sides (Bilateral / Crosses Midline)</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Section 4 -->
		<div class="quiz-section">
			<h3 class="quiz-section-title">4. Mechanical, Muscular &amp; Bruxism Clues</h3>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Do you wake up with tightness, soreness, or fatigue in your jaw muscles (masseters or&nbsp;temples)?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Morning jaw muscle tightness">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="yes-tightness">Yes (Morning Jaw Stiffness)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="sometimes-tight">Sometimes / Mild</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="no-tightness">No Tightness</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Have you caught yourself clenching your teeth, grinding at night, or pressing your tongue firmly against your teeth or the roof of your&nbsp;mouth?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Clenching, grinding, or tongue bracing">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="yes-bruxism">Yes (Clenching, Grinding, or Tongue Bracing)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="unaware">Not Sure / Possible</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="no-bruxism">No</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Do you experience clicking, popping, or catching in your jaw joint (TMJ) when you open wide or&nbsp;chew?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="TMJ clicking or popping">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="yes-tmj">Yes (Clicking / Popping TMJ)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="mild-tmj">Occasional Mild Clicking</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="no-tmj">No TMJ Issues</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Section 5 -->
		<div class="quiz-section">
			<h3 class="quiz-section-title">5. Salivary &amp; Sensory Symptoms</h3>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Does your mouth feel dry, sticky, or like sandpaper, even if you drink plenty of&nbsp;water?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Dry mouth and sandpaper feeling">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="severe-dry">Yes (Severe Dryness / Sandpaper Feel)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="moderate-dry">Moderately Dry</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="normal-saliva">No (Normal Saliva)</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Have you noticed any alteration in your sense of taste (dysgeusia), such as a persistent metallic, salty, or bitter&nbsp;taste?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Altered taste dysgeusia">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="yes-taste">Yes (Metallic, Bitter, or Salty Taste)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="mild-taste">Mild / Intermittent Alteration</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="normal-taste">No (Normal Taste)</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Do you feel gritty or dry eyes, joint aches, or chronic fatigue alongside the mouth discomfort (screening for autoimmune and Sjögren's&nbsp;conditions)?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Autoimmune Sjögren's screening">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="yes-autoimmune">Yes (Dry Eyes, Joint Aches, or Fatigue)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="mild-autoimmune">Mild / Some Symptoms</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="no-autoimmune">No (Screening Negative)</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Section 6 -->
		<div class="quiz-section">
			<h3 class="quiz-section-title">6. Dental History &amp; Restoration Margins</h3>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Have you had recent cleanings, root scaling, or dental work that seemed to trigger or worsen the&nbsp;burning?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Dental procedure onset">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="yes-procedure">Yes (Started or Flared After Dental Work)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="uncertain-procedure">Not Sure / Uncorrelated</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="no-procedure">No Previous Dental Trigger</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Do you have older crowns, composite fillings, or exposed root recessions at the gumline in the affected&nbsp;areas?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Crowns and cervical recessions">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="yes-restorations">Yes (Crowns, Recessions, or Fillings Present)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="minor-recessions">Minor Gumline Recession Only</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="no-restorations">No (Natural Intact Teeth)</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Has placing a filling, applying a desensitizing agent (like Gluma or fluoride), or having a professional cleaning ever temporarily improved the&nbsp;pain?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Desensitizer temporary relief">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="yes-relief">Yes (Temporary Relief Noticed)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="never-tried">Haven't Tried / Not Sure</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="no-change">No Change</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Section 7 -->
		<div class="quiz-section">
			<h3 class="quiz-section-title">7. Systemic, Medication &amp; Dietary Screen</h3>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Have you started any new blood pressure medications (especially ACE inhibitors), antidepressants, or inhalers around the time this&nbsp;started?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="New medication onset">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="yes-meds">Yes (Started New Medication Around Onset)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="multiple-meds">Multiple Med Changes</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="no-meds">No New Medications</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Have you been evaluated for systemic nutritional deficiencies, such as low B12, folate, ferritin or iron, or&nbsp;zinc?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Nutritional deficiency evaluation">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="yes-deficiencies">Yes, Deficiencies Confirmed</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="tested-normal">Tested Normal on Standard Labs</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="never-tested">Never Tested</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="quiz-item">
				<p class="quiz-question">Do you have a history of acid reflux (GERD or LPR), irritable bowel syndrome (IBS), or known food&nbsp;intolerances?</p>
				<div class="quiz-btn-group" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Reflux or GI history">
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="yes-reflux">Yes (Acid Reflux, GERD, or IBS History)</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="mild-reflux">Mild Occasional Heartburn</button>
					<button type="button" class="quiz-btn" data-val="no-reflux">No GI / Reflux History</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="quiz-submit-card">
			<button type="button" id="quiz-submit-btn" class="quiz-submit-button">Submit Anonymous Data</button>
			<p id="quiz-status-msg" class="quiz-status-msg"></p>
			<p class="quiz-privacy-note">100% Anonymous. No account or email needed.</p>
		</div>
	</form>
</div>

<script>
	document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
		const groups = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-btn-group');
		const submitBtn = document.getElementById('quiz-submit-btn');
		const statusMsg = document.getElementById('quiz-status-msg');

		groups.forEach(group => {
			const buttons = group.querySelectorAll('.quiz-btn');
			buttons.forEach(btn => {
				btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
					buttons.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
					btn.classList.add('active');
				});
			});
		});

		if (submitBtn && statusMsg) {
			submitBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
				const activeButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-btn.active');
				const totalQuestions = groups.length;
				submitBtn.disabled = true;
				statusMsg.textContent = `Thank you! Your responses (${activeButtons.length} of ${totalQuestions} answered) have been recorded anonymously.`;
				statusMsg.classList.add('success');
			});
		}
	});
</script>

<style>
	.bms-quiz-wrapper {
		background: #ffffff;
		border: 1px solid var(--card-border, #e2e8f0);
		border-radius: 20px;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		margin: 2.5rem auto;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
		width: 100%;
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}

	/* 80% width on Desktop and Tablet as requested */
	@media (min-width: 640px) {
		.bms-quiz-wrapper {
			width: 80%;
			max-width: 80%;
			padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
		}
	}

	.quiz-header-banner {
		background: #f8fafc;
		border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.quiz-callout {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: #334155;
		line-height: 1.5;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.quiz-section {
		margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
		padding-bottom: 1.75rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
	}

	.quiz-section:last-of-type {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.quiz-section-title {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #0f172a;
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.quiz-item {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.65rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
		padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
		background: #f8fafc;
		border-radius: 14px;
		border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
		transition: border-color 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease;
	}

	.quiz-item:hover {
		border-color: #cbd5e1;
		background: #f1f5f9;
	}

	.quiz-question {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.98rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #1e293b;
		line-height: 1.45;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.quiz-btn-group {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.45rem;
	}

	.quiz-btn {
		padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		border-radius: 8px;
		border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
		background: #ffffff;
		color: #334155;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: all 0.15s ease;
		outline: none;
		text-align: left;
	}

	.quiz-btn:hover {
		border-color: #94a3b8;
		background: #f8fafc;
	}

	/* Activated States */
	.quiz-btn.active {
		background: #10b981;
		border-color: #059669;
		color: #ffffff;
		box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
	}

	.quiz-submit-card {
		text-align: center;
		margin-top: 2rem;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 2px solid #f1f5f9;
	}

	.quiz-submit-button {
		background: #0f172a;
		color: #ffffff;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		padding: 0.85rem 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		border: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: background 0.15s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
	}

	.quiz-submit-button:hover {
		background: #1e293b;
		transform: translateY(-1px);
	}

	.quiz-status-msg {
		margin: 1rem 0 0;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #10b981;
	}

	.quiz-privacy-note {
		margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		color: #64748b;
	}
</style>
